1
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,759
Sorry, I thought Siqi was inside.

2
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:45,800
It's fine. Good thing you didn't come too early.

3
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:01,400
Brother Rong.

4
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:03,840
Siqi.

5
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,240
What are you up to?

6
00:03:05,719 --> 00:03:06,680
Xiaobai is inside.

7
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:15,280
So pretty.

8
00:03:15,639 --> 00:03:17,840
Siqi, why haven't you changed?

9
00:03:18,000 --> 00:03:18,919
We're going into the water!

10
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,520
I'll pass.

11
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:22,639
I'm worried it might be bad for the baby.

12
00:03:24,240 --> 00:03:24,800
I can already tell

13
00:03:24,879 --> 00:03:26,560
you'll make a wonderful mother.

14
00:03:27,439 --> 00:03:29,000
All right, you guys go ahead.

15
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,439
Go have fun.

16
00:03:30,719 --> 00:03:32,599
I'll walk around with Siqi.

17
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,319
Okay.

18
00:03:38,039 --> 00:03:39,280
Come on, let's head this way.

19
00:03:44,479 --> 00:03:45,159
Brother Long.

20
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:48,680
If only every day could be like this.

21
00:03:50,400 --> 00:03:51,240
In this world,

22
00:03:51,439 --> 00:03:53,319
many people choose different paths.

23
00:03:54,080 --> 00:03:55,360
A life like yours...

24
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:57,080
not everyone would enjoy it.

25
00:04:02,639 --> 00:04:03,439
Then...

26
00:04:04,479 --> 00:04:05,840
what kind of life do you want?

27
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,199
I'm someone who loves adventure.

28
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:11,680
So I choose a path different from the rest.

29
00:04:13,199 --> 00:04:16,160
If you want me to marry, have kids,

30
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,800
and live a quiet, ordinary life,

31
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,279
no way.

32
00:04:23,199 --> 00:04:25,680
No plans to marry my classmate?

33
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,160
Your classmate?

34
00:04:29,839 --> 00:04:31,000
You're overthinking it.

35
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:33,319
We're just partners.

36
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:34,920
Really?

37
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:37,040
She doesn't treat you like just a partner.

38
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:38,800
Is that so?

39
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:41,040
How come I haven't noticed?

40
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:44,240
Here's how I see it, bro.

41
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:45,639
If you don't feel the same,

42
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:46,959
you'd better tell her straight out.

43
00:04:47,120 --> 00:04:48,800
We can't just hurt her, right?

44
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:52,519
You really care about your old classmate.

45
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:56,800
Don't forget, you're a married man.

46
00:04:57,279 --> 00:04:58,319
You're reading too much into it, bro.

47
00:05:03,759 --> 00:05:07,720
So, enjoying the party today?

48
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:09,040
I love it.

49
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,199
At first, I thought the gathering meant

50
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,680
people in formal wear, classical music,

51
00:05:14,879 --> 00:05:15,920
sipping cocktails and things like that.

52
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,519
I never expected it to be like this.

53
00:05:17,759 --> 00:05:18,879
It's so much fun.

54
00:05:19,079 --> 00:05:19,720
Is that right?

55
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,199
I know plenty of other fun things.

56
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,519
Interested?

57
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,439
Bro, having fun is my thing.

58
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,800
If it's thrilling, Xiao Zhuang's your man.

59
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,600
All right, deal.

60
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,360
It's a deal.

61
00:05:31,439 --> 00:05:32,079
I'll go grab some beer.

62
00:05:32,199 --> 00:05:32,519
Sure.

63
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:39,160
Xiaoyi.

64
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,600
Well? Did you find anything?

65
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:13,199
On Long Zhiyuan's computer,

66
00:08:13,399 --> 00:08:14,519
there are records of Theerade

67
00:08:14,560 --> 00:08:16,199
and The Four Great Families' crimes.

68
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,360
The evidence he has

69
00:08:17,639 --> 00:08:19,120
surpasses that of Country M's police.

70
00:08:21,399 --> 00:08:22,879
Looks like our suspicions were right.

71
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,160
This Long Zhiyuan

72
00:08:24,399 --> 00:08:26,399
is more than a returned entrepreneur.

73
00:08:26,639 --> 00:08:27,680
He put so much effort into studying

74
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,680
Theerade and The Four Great Families.

75
00:08:30,680 --> 00:08:32,000
Is he looking to partner with them?

76
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:37,519
Long Zhiyuan is an utterly ambitious man.

77
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:41,559
I bet he doesn't just want to partner up.

78
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:43,399
He wants to monopolize Jiechan State,

79
00:08:43,799 --> 00:08:45,080
and become the new drug lord.

80
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,279
I've sent the data to Mai and Capt. Bai.

81
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,799
Combined with their investigation,

82
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:49,679
I believe we will soon

83
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,440
bring Theerade to justice.

84
00:08:58,360 --> 00:09:00,879
Didn't you go visit your old classmate?

85
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:02,320
How come you're back so soon?

86
00:09:07,240 --> 00:09:08,399
The doctor said it's nothing serious.

87
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:11,000
Besides, Long Zhiyuan is with her.

88
00:09:11,399 --> 00:09:14,080
With a rival beside the woman you love,

89
00:09:14,759 --> 00:09:16,519
how could you bear to leave so soon?

90
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:17,799
Rival?

91
00:09:18,679 --> 00:09:19,600
What do you mean?

92
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:22,080
As for her and me,

93
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:24,320
we're just innocent former classmates.

94
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,320
I was just asking.

95
00:09:30,399 --> 00:09:31,600
You don't need to explain so much to me.

96
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,200
Comrade Ge Dan,

97
00:09:35,399 --> 00:09:36,879
we are here on a mission,

98
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,720
not for you to casually

99
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:40,039
second-guess your colleague.

100
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:42,120
Just remember we're on a mission.

101
00:09:42,159 --> 00:09:43,440
I just hope that when it matters most,

102
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,320
you won't let emotions get in the way.

103
00:09:44,879 --> 00:09:46,080
She's close to Long Zhiyuan.

104
00:09:46,159 --> 00:09:46,960
Whether she's involved in his crimes,

105
00:09:47,039 --> 00:09:47,919
none of us knows.

106
00:09:48,279 --> 00:09:49,399
Unless it's to gather intelligence,

107
00:09:49,519 --> 00:09:50,960
I want you to keep your distance from her.

108
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,399
Xiaoyi isn't that kind of person.

109
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:58,799
Still saying you're not being emotional?

110
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,279
It's been so many years.

111
00:10:00,679 --> 00:10:02,480
How do you know who she is now?

112
00:10:13,679 --> 00:10:14,720
You're right.

113
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,759
It's been so long since we last met.

114
00:10:17,559 --> 00:10:18,720
How would I know?

115
00:10:21,279 --> 00:10:23,559
Still, no matter how much time has passed,

116
00:10:24,960 --> 00:10:26,559
I hope she's still the same.

117
00:10:29,840 --> 00:10:31,399
Do you remember what I told you?

118
00:10:31,600 --> 00:10:32,600
That Gu Xiaoyi...

119
00:10:34,480 --> 00:10:35,919
She's the girl who got hurt back then

120
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,840
all because I was a coward.

121
00:10:57,240 --> 00:10:58,320
So you're saying

122
00:10:59,600 --> 00:11:02,840
Gu Xiaoyi is that girl from back then?

123
00:11:05,559 --> 00:11:07,440
And you care so much about her

124
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:11,039
because of the guilt you've carried?

125
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:19,080
This guilt has haunted me for years.

126
00:11:19,639 --> 00:11:21,120
Fate brought her back into my life,

127
00:11:22,840 --> 00:11:24,159
probably so I could make amends

128
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,799
for my mistakes back then.

129
00:11:29,279 --> 00:11:31,519
You were still young back then.

130
00:11:32,360 --> 00:11:35,240
It was only natural to be scared.

131
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:38,000
Don't carry such a heavy burden.

132
00:11:38,559 --> 00:11:39,759
And don't let your guilt

133
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:41,480
blow your cover.

134
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:44,679
Understood.

135
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:47,799
Don't worry.

136
00:11:48,759 --> 00:11:50,080
I won't let personal feelings

137
00:11:50,559 --> 00:11:51,639
compromise the operation.

138
00:11:56,440 --> 00:11:57,000
Have some water.

139
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:21,799
Long Zhiyuan's computer holds files on

140
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:24,360
Theerade and The Four Great Families,

141
00:12:24,480 --> 00:12:25,960
as well as records

142
00:12:26,039 --> 00:12:28,000
from a joint drug raid 19 years ago.

143
00:12:28,639 --> 00:12:30,679
It even includes you, Chief Huang,

144
00:12:30,919 --> 00:12:33,639
and the late Comrade Tian Zheng.

145
00:12:35,759 --> 00:12:36,960
It seems Long Zhiyuan

146
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,879
not only secretly investigated

147
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:41,960
Theerade and The Four Great Families,

148
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:45,320
but also obtained internal intel

149
00:12:45,360 --> 00:12:46,440
from Country M's police force.

150
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:48,799
I imagine his gathering intel on Theerade

151
00:12:48,799 --> 00:12:50,480
and The Four Great Families

152
00:12:50,679 --> 00:12:53,440
is just to expand his criminal empire.

153
00:12:55,519 --> 00:12:56,480
But what I don't understand is

154
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:59,559
why he's so interested in

155
00:12:59,720 --> 00:13:00,600
an anti-drug operation

156
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,679
multinational police ran 19 years ago.

157
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,480
Reinvestigate Long Zhiyuan's path

158
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:10,120
before he went abroad,

159
00:13:10,440 --> 00:13:11,759
especially his family background.

160
00:13:11,960 --> 00:13:12,919
There must be secrets about him

161
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:15,399
that we still don't know.

162
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:16,120
Yes, sir.

163
00:13:21,639 --> 00:13:22,080
Thank you.

164
00:13:26,799 --> 00:13:27,799
It's pretty good.

165
00:13:29,919 --> 00:13:31,240
Never expected a billionaire like you

166
00:13:31,679 --> 00:13:32,679
to eat at a street stall.

167
00:13:34,039 --> 00:13:36,039
Street food has its own unique flavor.

168
00:13:36,639 --> 00:13:39,000
Besides, I'm no stranger to hardship.

169
00:13:40,039 --> 00:13:41,120
Bitter first, sweet later.

170
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:42,519
Cheers.

171
00:13:51,000 --> 00:13:52,000
Life, you know,

172
00:13:52,320 --> 00:13:54,080
is really just a journey.

173
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:56,000
Only by constantly pushing yourself

174
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:58,080
can you see the finer sights.

175
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:03,840
Most people don't know how to value life.

176
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:06,240
Ordinary people just spend their lives

177
00:14:06,840 --> 00:14:10,240
repeating the same routine day after day.

178
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:12,320
But we're different.

179
00:14:12,960 --> 00:14:15,120
We keep control in our own hands,

180
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:17,159
experience so much more,

181
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,639
and live far more thrilling lives.

182
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,919
You could sit on a golden throne,

183
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:23,000
or end up behind bars.

184
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,399
That's what real ambition is for a man.

185
00:14:25,559 --> 00:14:26,440
As it should be.

186
00:14:27,399 --> 00:14:29,039
Translated into plain words, you mean

187
00:14:30,159 --> 00:14:32,360
Not just surviving, but chasing the rush.

188
00:14:32,519 --> 00:14:34,559
You compare others' lives to plain rice,

189
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:37,039
and your own to weed.

190
00:14:38,360 --> 00:14:40,480
Using weed as a metaphor...

191
00:14:41,639 --> 00:14:42,639
it fits pretty well.

192
00:14:43,639 --> 00:14:48,600
Though heroin gives a bigger rush.

193
00:14:51,039 --> 00:14:53,799
Comparing your life to doing heroin...

194
00:14:54,159 --> 00:14:55,320
You're an interesting man.

195
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:03,480
I'm very confident in my read on people.

196
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:07,360
I can tell you're a talented man.

197
00:15:08,639 --> 00:15:12,120
You're destined for great things.

198
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:13,759
You flatter me.

199
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,360
I'm just an errand boy.

200
00:15:16,919 --> 00:15:19,399
Theerade runs such a massive business.

201
00:15:19,639 --> 00:15:22,279
You'll definitely have a future with him.

202
00:15:24,320 --> 00:15:26,639
But if you're not content with that,

203
00:15:27,080 --> 00:15:29,799
you're welcome to join my team.

204
00:15:31,919 --> 00:15:32,919
Your team?

205
00:15:33,840 --> 00:15:36,080
What do you mean, international trade?

206
00:15:39,519 --> 00:15:40,679
You could call it international trade.

207
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:44,240
Just dancing on a razor's edge.

208
00:15:46,600 --> 00:15:47,720
Don't tell me...

209
00:15:48,519 --> 00:15:50,039
you're dealing drugs?

210
00:15:53,039 --> 00:15:55,000
We're cut from the same cloth.

211
00:16:00,159 --> 00:16:01,600
If you see me as a brother,

212
00:16:02,279 --> 00:16:03,440
you can be straight with me.

213
00:16:09,240 --> 00:16:09,840
Put it this way.

214
00:16:11,039 --> 00:16:13,399
Theerade's vision is too small.

215
00:16:14,240 --> 00:16:17,360
The most he'll ever do is stand equal

216
00:16:17,360 --> 00:16:18,519
to The Four Great Families.

217
00:16:19,679 --> 00:16:20,840
But I'm different.

218
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:23,159
What I want is all of Jiechan State.

219
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:27,879
A wise bird chooses where it perches.

220
00:16:28,039 --> 00:16:30,320
I promise if you follow me,

221
00:16:30,759 --> 00:16:31,759
in a few years,

222
00:16:32,159 --> 00:16:34,279
you'll be where Theerade is today.

223
00:16:43,879 --> 00:16:46,360
Just tell me what you need.

224
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,559
Arrange something for me.

225
00:16:50,279 --> 00:16:51,519
I want to see Theerade.

226
00:17:08,480 --> 00:17:10,599
Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu killed Xiang Nan.

227
00:17:11,279 --> 00:17:12,880
Piyazi has been out for revenge.

228
00:17:14,039 --> 00:17:16,119
Partnering with Theerade right now...

229
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:19,240
don't you owe Piyazi an explanation?

230
00:17:20,799 --> 00:17:22,000
I'm his boss.

231
00:17:22,920 --> 00:17:24,160
What do I owe him?

232
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:26,799
But Piyazi...

233
00:17:28,519 --> 00:17:29,680
I'm approaching Theerade

234
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:32,119
precisely to settle the score for Piyazi.

235
00:17:33,960 --> 00:17:35,400
You want Theerade

236
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:38,960
to hand over Qin Mu and Ma Jingrong?

237
00:17:41,960 --> 00:17:43,759
Franklin once said,

238
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:46,240
if you want to make someone a friend,

239
00:17:48,359 --> 00:17:51,599
you must first ask a favor of them.

240
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:55,640
By doing me such a huge favor,

241
00:17:56,039 --> 00:17:58,039
he'll certainly have terms of his own.

242
00:18:00,839 --> 00:18:03,880
That way, he can naturally

243
00:18:03,880 --> 00:18:05,359
partner with you.

244
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,759
So many people around me

245
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:11,000
think that working for me

246
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:13,000
was their own choice.

247
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:19,759
What about Zhuang Cen?

248
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:23,680
Is he worth this much effort to win over?

249
00:18:25,640 --> 00:18:26,640
When I look at Zhuang Cen,

250
00:18:26,839 --> 00:18:28,599
I see my younger self.

251
00:18:30,720 --> 00:18:31,720
He's a lot like me.

252
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,519
Besides, right now,

253
00:18:34,279 --> 00:18:35,680
he's still useful to me.

254
00:18:46,039 --> 00:18:48,680
What's on your mind, standing out here?

255
00:18:54,240 --> 00:18:58,799
Don't you think dinner with Theerade

256
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:01,279
felt a little off the other day?

257
00:19:02,960 --> 00:19:03,640
Did it?

258
00:19:04,920 --> 00:19:07,880
Didn't he just show up a bit late?

259
00:19:10,920 --> 00:19:12,519
Before Theerade arrived,

260
00:19:13,359 --> 00:19:15,640
his men held us at gunpoint and said

261
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,880
no one was allowed to leave.

262
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,039
Why do I get the feeling

263
00:19:25,359 --> 00:19:27,359
that we just dodged a bullet?

264
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:33,519
You mean Theerade's dinner that night

265
00:19:34,519 --> 00:19:36,480
was actually a trap for us?

266
00:19:40,799 --> 00:19:42,839
What's he suspicious of?

267
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:46,200
Back then, around Qin Mu,

268
00:19:46,240 --> 00:19:47,720
a police mole was exposed.

269
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:50,400
Could Theerade be suspecting

270
00:19:50,440 --> 00:19:52,160
there's another cop among us?

271
00:19:55,039 --> 00:19:58,359
I don't trust anyone around me anymore.

272
00:20:12,240 --> 00:20:13,160
Who do you suspect?

273
00:20:15,079 --> 00:20:15,680
Boss,

274
00:20:17,599 --> 00:20:19,240
this is my brother, Li Qiang.

275
00:20:38,839 --> 00:20:41,480
Don't you think Xiao Zhuang and his wife

276
00:20:42,319 --> 00:20:43,559
are acting strange?

277
00:20:44,599 --> 00:20:45,920
You suspect them?

278
00:20:47,200 --> 00:20:47,960
I doubt it.

279
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,200
They saved my life.

280
00:20:49,759 --> 00:20:51,240
Aren't you overthinking it?

281
00:20:54,240 --> 00:20:55,680
Someone else saved you too.

282
00:20:56,759 --> 00:20:57,559
Long Zhiyuan.

283
00:20:59,359 --> 00:21:03,319
Even though I've never met Long Zhiyuan,

284
00:21:03,759 --> 00:21:05,480
we still laundered money

285
00:21:05,839 --> 00:21:07,680
through Longze Group.

286
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,960
Him suddenly showing up in Country M...

287
00:21:11,920 --> 00:21:13,319
is that really just a coincidence?

288
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:20,200
But Piyazi and Chen Hai said before

289
00:21:20,599 --> 00:21:22,720
that Long Zhiyuan knew nothing

290
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:23,839
about the money laundering.

291
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,599
Are you suspecting now

292
00:21:26,160 --> 00:21:27,960
that Long Zhiyuan works under Piyazi?

293
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:31,079
Maybe it's the exact opposite.

294
00:21:34,279 --> 00:21:35,880
Aren't you being too cautious?

295
00:21:36,119 --> 00:21:38,480
You think Xiaobai and Zhuang Cen are cops,

296
00:21:38,799 --> 00:21:39,720
and the next you suspect

297
00:21:40,039 --> 00:21:41,920
Long Zhiyuan is connected to Piyazi.

298
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:45,359
Maybe it's not that complicated.

299
00:21:48,440 --> 00:21:50,039
If I'm right,

300
00:21:51,119 --> 00:21:53,839
we must prepare an exit plan immediately.

301
00:21:56,079 --> 00:21:57,799
If things are really as you say,

302
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:59,759
shouldn't we leave here right away?

303
00:22:00,680 --> 00:22:01,200
If I leave right now,

304
00:22:01,240 --> 00:22:02,920
Theerade definitely won't let me off.

305
00:22:03,799 --> 00:22:04,720
Regardless,

306
00:22:05,160 --> 00:22:06,559
stick to the plan: you leave first.

307
00:22:07,440 --> 00:22:08,920
I'll try to take three months

308
00:22:09,359 --> 00:22:10,720
to wrap things up here.

309
00:22:13,359 --> 00:22:15,759
Okay, then you must be careful.

310
00:22:18,279 --> 00:22:18,960
Don't worry.

311
00:22:35,759 --> 00:22:36,119
Brother Long.

312
00:22:36,279 --> 00:22:36,799
Xiao Zhuang.

313
00:22:38,759 --> 00:22:40,039
Mr. Theerade is already waiting.

314
00:22:40,319 --> 00:22:40,920
Good.

315
00:22:41,279 --> 00:22:42,400
After today,

316
00:22:42,920 --> 00:22:44,920
you and I will be in the same boat.

317
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:47,119
Afraid of rough winds out there?

318
00:22:47,720 --> 00:22:49,799
I'm chasing the rush, not just surviving.

319
00:22:50,079 --> 00:22:51,359
Good. After you.

320
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:55,359
I hear you're in global trade, Mr. Long.

321
00:22:55,680 --> 00:22:58,119
Our firm handles plenty of exports too.

322
00:22:58,839 --> 00:23:00,200
I hope we'll have an opportunity

323
00:23:00,559 --> 00:23:01,680
to partner up in the future.

324
00:23:02,359 --> 00:23:05,079
Your enterprise is massive, Mr. Theerade,

325
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:08,200
you wouldn't care for my small business.

326
00:23:10,759 --> 00:23:12,960
If you won't partner with me, Mr. Long,

327
00:23:13,480 --> 00:23:15,079
why meet today?

328
00:23:15,119 --> 00:23:15,960
What I mean is,

329
00:23:16,599 --> 00:23:19,720
Mr. Theerade, international trade itself

330
00:23:20,039 --> 00:23:21,480
probably holds little interest for you.

331
00:23:21,960 --> 00:23:22,960
If we partner up,

332
00:23:23,200 --> 00:23:24,640
we could easily join forces

333
00:23:25,160 --> 00:23:27,480
on things that truly interest both of us.

334
00:23:27,880 --> 00:23:30,200
I came today mainly to ask

335
00:23:30,559 --> 00:23:32,400
for a favor from you, Mr. Theerade.

336
00:23:34,799 --> 00:23:36,079
Whatever it is, Mr. Long,

337
00:23:36,079 --> 00:23:37,160
just say the word.

338
00:23:37,400 --> 00:23:38,519
As long as it's within my power,

339
00:23:38,680 --> 00:23:39,839
I won't hesitate.

340
00:23:41,000 --> 00:23:45,440
I'd like to ask you for two lives.

341
00:23:54,000 --> 00:23:56,000
You speak in riddles, Mr. Long.

342
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,279
I don't quite follow.

343
00:24:01,839 --> 00:24:02,680
Since lives are at stake,

344
00:24:02,839 --> 00:24:05,000
could you and I, Mr. Theerade,

345
00:24:05,920 --> 00:24:07,000
speak in private?

346
00:24:16,000 --> 00:24:17,000
You all step outside.

347
00:24:17,839 --> 00:24:19,119
Xiao Zhuang, you leave too.

348
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:20,160
Understood.

349
00:24:31,240 --> 00:24:32,359
We're alone now.

350
00:24:32,720 --> 00:24:34,640
Speak your mind, Mr. Long.

351
00:24:36,400 --> 00:24:40,039
I want Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu's lives.

352
00:24:42,880 --> 00:24:45,519
I thought you were a mere businessman.

353
00:24:46,119 --> 00:24:47,720
Why would you want someone dead?

354
00:24:49,559 --> 00:24:53,000
Because Piyazi worked for me.

355
00:24:56,640 --> 00:24:57,880
I see.

356
00:24:58,480 --> 00:25:00,480
Put that way, I understand.

357
00:25:01,599 --> 00:25:03,720
There's always a bigger fish.

358
00:25:05,359 --> 00:25:07,519
I always felt that a man like Piyazi

359
00:25:08,079 --> 00:25:10,200
could never build such a huge enterprise.

360
00:25:10,880 --> 00:25:11,799
Turns out, behind him,

361
00:25:12,160 --> 00:25:13,640
stood an expert like you, Mr. Long.

362
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:16,519
It seems you didn't come to me today

363
00:25:16,599 --> 00:25:17,640
to discuss business,

364
00:25:18,160 --> 00:25:19,599
but to seek vengeance

365
00:25:19,920 --> 00:25:20,640
for your man.

366
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:22,119
Vengeance?

367
00:25:22,599 --> 00:25:24,599
That's an exaggeration.

368
00:25:25,839 --> 00:25:27,559
In all sincerity,

369
00:25:28,000 --> 00:25:29,680
I'm just asking for a small favor.

370
00:25:30,440 --> 00:25:34,000
This is nothing to you.

371
00:25:36,680 --> 00:25:38,640
Mr. Long, we've only just met.

372
00:25:38,839 --> 00:25:39,759
Normally,

373
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:42,200
I should offer you a generous gift.

374
00:25:43,200 --> 00:25:45,440
But if I do what you ask,

375
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:47,720
I'm afraid it breaks the rules.

376
00:25:50,000 --> 00:25:50,920
The scenery here is nice.

377
00:25:53,079 --> 00:25:53,599
Isn't it?

378
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:57,640
Even so, it doesn't feel like home.

379
00:26:00,160 --> 00:26:01,160
If you miss home,

380
00:26:01,599 --> 00:26:02,559
why not go back?

381
00:26:04,880 --> 00:26:06,839
Maybe I've been drifting for too long.

382
00:26:07,400 --> 00:26:08,839
I've lost the feeling of home.

383
00:26:11,079 --> 00:26:12,559
Even if I went back to Nanhai now,

384
00:26:13,720 --> 00:26:14,960
things would never be the same.

385
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:18,599
Time is like God.

386
00:26:19,559 --> 00:26:21,000
What it takes away from you,

387
00:26:21,839 --> 00:26:23,480
you can never get back.

388
00:26:28,720 --> 00:26:30,039
So how have you been doing?

389
00:26:32,880 --> 00:26:35,039
You've asked me that more than once.

390
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:36,480
Why?

391
00:26:37,079 --> 00:26:38,759
Do you think I'm unhappy right now?

392
00:26:41,000 --> 00:26:41,680
Do you even know

393
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:42,880
what Long Zhiyuan really does?

394
00:26:45,279 --> 00:26:46,640
What you know,

395
00:26:47,759 --> 00:26:48,680
and what I know,

396
00:26:49,400 --> 00:26:50,079
are the same.

397
00:26:50,839 --> 00:26:51,440
Since you know,

398
00:26:51,480 --> 00:26:52,279
why stay?

399
00:26:52,880 --> 00:26:54,039
Why stay by his side?

400
00:26:54,920 --> 00:26:57,559
What's wrong with being with him?

401
00:27:01,319 --> 00:27:02,880
I work for Chairman Long

402
00:27:03,920 --> 00:27:05,599
because I had no better path to take.

403
00:27:08,839 --> 00:27:09,559
And besides,

404
00:27:10,240 --> 00:27:10,920
as you know,

405
00:27:11,240 --> 00:27:12,480
this path is very risky.

406
00:27:13,279 --> 00:27:15,079
Once on it, there's no turning back.

407
00:27:15,319 --> 00:27:17,279
Me, I'm used to living recklessly.

408
00:27:18,759 --> 00:27:19,400
But you...

409
00:27:20,359 --> 00:27:21,559
you're a woman, after all.

410
00:27:23,319 --> 00:27:24,359
What's wrong with being a woman?

411
00:27:24,839 --> 00:27:26,240
Is that gender discrimination?

412
00:27:26,960 --> 00:27:27,480
No.

413
00:27:28,759 --> 00:27:29,720
What I mean is,

414
00:27:31,480 --> 00:27:33,359
a woman deserves a peaceful life.

415
00:27:45,279 --> 00:27:47,359
That peaceful life you talked about,

416
00:27:50,559 --> 00:27:52,119
ever since I was nine,

417
00:27:54,160 --> 00:27:55,759
has been long gone.

418
00:28:13,200 --> 00:28:15,119
For a long time,

419
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:19,279
I would wake up from nightmares every morning.

420
00:28:21,359 --> 00:28:24,000
Until one day, I met him.

421
00:28:25,319 --> 00:28:26,200
Only then did I realize

422
00:28:26,920 --> 00:28:28,319
that in this world,

423
00:28:28,920 --> 00:28:30,880
there was still someone who could protect me.

424
00:28:34,920 --> 00:28:35,759
I know that

425
00:28:36,720 --> 00:28:38,000
in other people's eyes,

426
00:28:38,400 --> 00:28:39,720
he isn't a perfect man.

427
00:28:41,039 --> 00:28:43,359
He isn't even a good person.

428
00:28:44,440 --> 00:28:45,839
But to me,

429
00:28:49,240 --> 00:28:50,279
he's the one

430
00:28:50,799 --> 00:28:52,839
who holds the umbrella for me in the rain.

431
00:28:54,119 --> 00:28:55,000
By his side,

432
00:28:56,079 --> 00:28:57,480
I finally feel at peace.

433
00:29:04,480 --> 00:29:05,160
I'm sorry,

434
00:29:10,640 --> 00:29:11,160
Xiaoyi.

435
00:29:11,839 --> 00:29:13,960
I've always wanted to apologize to you in person.

436
00:29:20,200 --> 00:29:20,960
It's fine.

437
00:29:21,519 --> 00:29:22,720
It wasn't your fault anyway.

438
00:29:25,599 --> 00:29:26,599
Let's not dwell on it.

439
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:29,119
Since you've decided to work with Zhiyuan now,

440
00:29:29,160 --> 00:29:30,680
there's no need to overthink it.

441
00:29:32,039 --> 00:29:33,160
That's just how life is, you know?

442
00:29:33,400 --> 00:29:34,680
Between tomorrow and the unexpected,

443
00:29:35,079 --> 00:29:37,160
we never know which will come first.

444
00:29:38,400 --> 00:29:40,000
As long as we live each day happily,

445
00:29:40,400 --> 00:29:41,839
isn't that already a win?

446
00:29:51,119 --> 00:29:52,599
Why make things so serious?

447
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,240
The rules of the underworld

448
00:30:02,640 --> 00:30:04,960
are dictated by people like us.

449
00:30:06,599 --> 00:30:07,559
I respect you,

450
00:30:07,920 --> 00:30:09,920
which is why I'm asking you directly.

451
00:30:11,240 --> 00:30:14,240
I don't want my men and yours

452
00:30:14,799 --> 00:30:16,200
to have any conflict.

453
00:30:16,799 --> 00:30:19,640
Nor do I want our disagreements

454
00:30:21,160 --> 00:30:23,440
to let others take advantage.

455
00:30:24,799 --> 00:30:27,759
To you, Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu

456
00:30:28,400 --> 00:30:29,880
aren't really your own men.

457
00:30:31,319 --> 00:30:33,039
How much value they have to you,

458
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:34,880
you know best yourself.

459
00:30:35,880 --> 00:30:37,799
Hand the two of them over to me,

460
00:30:39,319 --> 00:30:42,480
and my men will never cross you.

461
00:30:43,240 --> 00:30:46,160
Wouldn't that keep the peace?

462
00:30:48,839 --> 00:30:51,960
Ma and Qin killed your men first.

463
00:30:52,119 --> 00:30:53,400
By rights,

464
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:56,480
I should give you an explanation.

465
00:30:58,079 --> 00:30:59,480
But doing this...

466
00:31:00,799 --> 00:31:02,039
what's in it for me?

467
00:31:04,039 --> 00:31:07,799
I know you have big plans, Mr. Theerade,

468
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:09,440
and grand ambitions.

469
00:31:09,880 --> 00:31:13,839
Yet The Four Great Families hold you back.

470
00:31:15,279 --> 00:31:17,119
If you hand the two of them over to me,

471
00:31:17,359 --> 00:31:19,839
we can join forces.

472
00:31:20,759 --> 00:31:24,160
Then we'll stand shoulder to shoulder,

473
00:31:24,880 --> 00:31:25,720
achieving great things together.

474
00:31:26,119 --> 00:31:28,000
Wouldn't that be a win for both of us?

475
00:31:34,839 --> 00:31:35,400
Fine.

476
00:31:35,920 --> 00:31:37,000
Then consider these two lives

477
00:31:37,240 --> 00:31:39,480
my introductory gift to Mr. Long.

478
00:31:39,640 --> 00:31:40,480
Thank you.

479
00:31:59,720 --> 00:32:00,279
Chief Huang,

480
00:32:00,839 --> 00:32:02,200
with help from the Provincial Department,

481
00:32:02,279 --> 00:32:04,200
we've uncovered leads on Long Zhiyuan.

482
00:32:06,599 --> 00:32:08,240
During Long Zhiyuan's studies abroad,

483
00:32:08,279 --> 00:32:09,079
all of his expenses

484
00:32:09,279 --> 00:32:10,359
came from

485
00:32:10,359 --> 00:32:12,079
an offshore account in the Cayman Islands.

486
00:32:12,279 --> 00:32:14,200
The account holder, Chen Xiaoqing,

487
00:32:14,640 --> 00:32:16,200
is a distant cousin of Cheng Fei.

488
00:32:22,720 --> 00:32:24,000
Are you saying

489
00:32:24,200 --> 00:32:26,359
that between Long Zhiyuan and Cheng Fei,

490
00:32:26,559 --> 00:32:27,519
there might be a connection?

491
00:32:27,680 --> 00:32:28,079
Yes.

492
00:32:28,240 --> 00:32:30,440
19 years ago, Tian Zheng and I

493
00:32:30,440 --> 00:32:31,799
were tasked with arresting Cheng Fei.

494
00:32:31,880 --> 00:32:33,720
Cheng Fei died at the hands of

495
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:35,079
Theerade's father, Jessadabond.

496
00:32:35,400 --> 00:32:37,359
Our mission back then ended in failure.

497
00:32:37,440 --> 00:32:38,960
But we also discovered

498
00:32:39,279 --> 00:32:41,599
that Cheng Fei had a son with his ex-wife,

499
00:32:41,680 --> 00:32:43,440
who vanished 19 years ago.

500
00:32:43,920 --> 00:32:45,079
Now we suspect

501
00:32:45,599 --> 00:32:48,839
Long Zhiyuan is very likely Cheng Fei's son.

502
00:32:57,160 --> 00:33:00,759
If Long Zhiyuan is indeed Cheng Fei's son,

503
00:33:00,920 --> 00:33:02,200
then that explains

504
00:33:02,400 --> 00:33:04,160
why he built this drug cartel.

505
00:33:04,559 --> 00:33:06,599
Then his intel on you, Comrade Tian Zheng,

506
00:33:06,880 --> 00:33:08,160
and Theerade

507
00:33:08,319 --> 00:33:09,440
can only have one objective.

508
00:33:10,119 --> 00:33:11,039
He wants revenge.

509
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:14,839
I'll pass this intel

510
00:33:15,000 --> 00:33:16,759
to Zhuang Yan and Wei Kai ASAP.

511
00:33:16,920 --> 00:33:18,640
Good. Stay safe out there.

512
00:33:19,759 --> 00:33:20,400
Copy that.

513
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,880
What Mr. Long needs,

514
00:33:27,359 --> 00:33:29,160
I'll have ready for him ASAP.

515
00:33:31,039 --> 00:33:34,240
I'll definitely deliver on my promise.

516
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:35,880
In just a few days,

517
00:33:36,480 --> 00:33:37,039
in Jiechan State,

518
00:33:37,559 --> 00:33:39,599
those four old bastards will be gone.

519
00:33:41,200 --> 00:33:41,640
Goodbye.

520
00:33:41,839 --> 00:33:42,400
Goodbye.

521
00:33:48,680 --> 00:33:49,279
Sir.

522
00:33:51,240 --> 00:33:51,880
Well done.

523
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,720
You've got a sharp mind.

524
00:33:55,079 --> 00:33:56,359
Having you by my side

525
00:33:56,680 --> 00:33:57,599
puts my mind at ease.

526
00:33:59,960 --> 00:34:00,839
Find an opportunity

527
00:34:01,440 --> 00:34:03,799
to take out Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu.

528
00:34:04,440 --> 00:34:07,119
Jiang Liye's old position will be yours.

529
00:34:38,239 --> 00:34:39,599
I have Ge Xiaobai.

530
00:34:40,280 --> 00:34:41,000
Who are you?

531
00:34:41,679 --> 00:34:42,320
Where are you right now?

532
00:34:43,320 --> 00:34:45,519
Be at the location I send in 15 minutes.

533
00:34:46,000 --> 00:34:48,440
Remember, come alone. Don't alert anyone.

534
00:34:48,559 --> 00:34:49,719
You know the consequences.

535
00:35:09,400 --> 00:35:10,079
Captain Bai.

536
00:35:10,320 --> 00:35:11,360
Ge Dan has been kidnapped.

537
00:35:12,280 --> 00:35:14,199
When? Who are the kidnappers?

538
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:15,280
Not sure yet.

539
00:35:16,519 --> 00:35:17,519
I'm heading there right now.

540
00:35:19,360 --> 00:35:21,480
Zhuang Yan, don't be reckless. Stay calm.

541
00:35:21,559 --> 00:35:22,320
Keep yourself safe.

542
00:35:22,840 --> 00:35:24,320
I'll contact Inspector Mai right away.

543
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:25,360
Stay in touch.

544
00:35:25,519 --> 00:35:25,880
Copy that.

545
00:35:28,159 --> 00:35:29,079
Who was kidnapped?

546
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,039
Ge Dan.

547
00:35:30,320 --> 00:35:31,440
Zhuang Yan is heading over right now.

548
00:35:34,239 --> 00:35:36,559
Inspector Mai, emergency. We need backup.

549
00:36:07,559 --> 00:36:08,159
Start talking.

550
00:36:12,400 --> 00:36:15,400
Who are you and Xiao Zhuang really?

551
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,599
I don't know what you're talking about.

552
00:36:22,519 --> 00:36:23,840
And to think we saved you.

553
00:36:32,199 --> 00:36:33,280
The two of you...

554
00:36:34,360 --> 00:36:36,760
just wanted to use me to get to Theerade,

555
00:36:37,079 --> 00:36:37,760
didn't you?

556
00:36:50,239 --> 00:36:52,960
Xiao Zhuang did time for robbing dealers.

557
00:36:53,480 --> 00:36:56,480
I saved him because I'm his wife.

558
00:36:59,280 --> 00:37:00,639
That was all an act.

559
00:37:00,679 --> 00:37:02,280
You can't fool me.

560
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:05,400
You were onto me back in Nanhai.

561
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:06,519
You were onto Li Qiang, too.

562
00:37:08,360 --> 00:37:09,239
As soon as Li Qiang arrived,

563
00:37:09,280 --> 00:37:11,519
the police went after him. Why?

564
00:37:15,159 --> 00:37:18,760
To protect their undercover cop.

565
00:37:32,920 --> 00:37:34,360
My brother, Li Qiang,

566
00:37:35,039 --> 00:37:37,840
knows who you and Xiao Zhuang really are.

567
00:37:42,199 --> 00:37:43,199
Don't you forget,

568
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:45,599
we saved your life,

569
00:37:45,760 --> 00:37:46,960
and your wife's, too.

570
00:37:48,199 --> 00:37:49,360
Xiao Zhuang is your brother,

571
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:50,920
yet now you suspect him?

572
00:37:58,079 --> 00:37:59,280
If you're not an undercover cop,

573
00:37:59,440 --> 00:38:01,119
why, out in the square, was my brother's

574
00:38:01,320 --> 00:38:03,239
first instinct the moment he saw you

575
00:38:03,280 --> 00:38:04,440
to draw his gun?

576
00:38:08,599 --> 00:38:10,880
Because you clashed back in Nanhai.

577
00:38:12,440 --> 00:38:15,280
Li Qiang saw your face and Xiao Zhuang's.

578
00:38:15,599 --> 00:38:16,840
There were so many people in that square.

579
00:38:17,239 --> 00:38:19,039
How do you know it was me he drew on?

580
00:38:23,039 --> 00:38:24,639
The one on the motorcycle

581
00:38:24,960 --> 00:38:27,760
who blocked Li Qiang was Xiao Zhuang?

582
00:38:33,719 --> 00:38:35,519
As for you secretly downloading files

583
00:38:35,639 --> 00:38:36,920
right from Long Zhiyuan's computer,

584
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:38,840
I saw it with my own eyes.

585
00:38:39,920 --> 00:38:41,519
How do you explain that to me?

586
00:38:45,559 --> 00:38:49,159
Long Zhiyuan is Piyazi's boss.

587
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:51,719
You're investigating him.

588
00:38:52,760 --> 00:38:53,760
I'm right, aren't I?

589
00:39:37,599 --> 00:39:38,280
Zhuang Cen.

590
00:39:39,719 --> 00:39:41,360
Brother, you're here.

591
00:39:44,440 --> 00:39:46,639
Brother Ma, what are you doing?

592
00:39:52,719 --> 00:39:53,199
Xiao Zhuang.

593
00:39:55,639 --> 00:39:58,400
You're a cop, and I'm a criminal.

594
00:39:58,559 --> 00:40:00,440
Cops and criminals can never mix.

595
00:40:03,840 --> 00:40:07,400
Today, we settle this right here.

596
00:40:07,639 --> 00:40:09,599
I'll give you two options.

597
00:40:09,760 --> 00:40:10,239
One.

598
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:14,559
Die together right here as lovers.

599
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:15,880
Two.

600
00:40:17,159 --> 00:40:21,199
You call Theerade yourself

601
00:40:21,920 --> 00:40:25,360
and tell him who you both really are.

602
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:39,920
Maybe for brotherhood's sake,

603
00:40:40,000 --> 00:40:41,000
if my heart softens,

604
00:40:43,119 --> 00:40:45,199
I might just let the two of you leave.

605
00:40:45,840 --> 00:40:46,719
Don't listen to him!

606
00:40:46,719 --> 00:40:47,679
Shut up!

607
00:40:48,199 --> 00:40:49,760
I'll give you one minute.

608
00:40:51,920 --> 00:40:53,679
If you don't care about her,

609
00:40:54,199 --> 00:40:56,679
I can save myself that minute.

610
00:41:21,800 --> 00:41:22,760
It's me, Xiao Zhuang.

611
00:41:24,559 --> 00:41:26,039
I'm with Ma Jingrong right now.

612
00:41:29,079 --> 00:41:30,400
Do what you have to do.

613
00:41:32,679 --> 00:41:33,199
Understood.

614
00:41:47,599 --> 00:41:49,360
You didn't do as I asked.

615
00:41:52,159 --> 00:41:54,840
Mr. Theerade told me to kill you both.

616
00:42:01,039 --> 00:42:02,400
Say that again.

617
00:42:05,400 --> 00:42:09,320
Long Zhiyuan and Theerade joined forces.

618
00:42:09,840 --> 00:42:12,760
He wants Theerade to answer for Xiang Nan.

619
00:42:14,079 --> 00:42:16,119
You two have been betrayed.

620
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:26,519
Why should we believe you?

621
00:42:28,360 --> 00:42:29,039
Evidence.

622
00:42:36,119 --> 00:42:37,559
Ma Jingrong and Qin Mu...

623
00:42:38,440 --> 00:42:39,239
To you,

624
00:42:40,199 --> 00:42:41,679
they aren't really your own men.

625
00:42:42,239 --> 00:42:43,719
How much they're worth to you,

626
00:42:44,679 --> 00:42:45,960
you know better than anyone.

627
00:42:47,079 --> 00:42:48,679
Hand both of them over to me,

628
00:42:49,320 --> 00:42:53,800
and my men will never cross you.

629
00:42:54,480 --> 00:42:57,960
Wouldn't that keep the peace?

630
00:42:59,840 --> 00:43:00,320
All right.

631
00:43:01,400 --> 00:43:02,519
Then these two lives

632
00:43:02,960 --> 00:43:05,400
will be my welcoming gift to Mr. Long.
